# Env files are split by app:
#
#   backend/.env.example  →  copy to backend/.env   (Django)
#   frontend/.env.development + .env.production (in repo) set VITE_DJANGO_URL → https://web-production-77db8.up.railway.app
#   Optional override: frontend/.env.local with VITE_DJANGO_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000 for local Django
#
# Repo root: you can run ``python manage.py`` from here (it delegates to backend/).
